# Cat Carrier (Black Tabby) from the Dalaran mages of Ambermill.
# Sources: items.json (Dalaran Spellscribe 17%, other Dalaran mages 0.2%,
# pfQuest; pfQuest calls it Maine Coon); Forever client 1.60.1.70338 (name).
# Our data marks these mages friendly to the Alliance, so this guide is Horde
# only; Alliance players buy it on the Auction House.

step Dalaran Spellscribe
  tip The Dalaran Spellscribe, a rare spawn among the mages at Ambermill in southern Silverpine Forest, drops it about 17% of the time in our data; the other Dalaran mages at Ambermill and around the Dalaran crater drop it at about 0.2%. Kill the mages until the Spellscribe appears. Alliance players buy it on the Auction House.
  collect 8491 "Cat Carrier (Black Tabby)" @63.5,63.3 -- Ambermill
